window.LZ_I18N={"en": {"nav.login": "Sign in", "nav.home": "Back to Leveza", "motto": "We conceive destinations where great design, longevity, and coastal ease come together — places built around how people actually want to&nbsp;feel.", "lux.h": "Luxury,<br><em>weighed differently.</em>", "lux.p": "Leveza is luxury measured by what it removes: weight, noise, effort, heat. The feeling of a body after a swim. Of a house that asks nothing of you. Of a day with no traffic in it. Everything in it is of the highest quality, and none of it announces itself — the stone, the lime, the linen, the silence.", "std.kicker": "The four standards", "agua.s": "07:04 · water", "sombra.s": "13:00 · shade", "mesa.s": "19:30 · the table", "sono.s": "23:10 · sleep", "std.note": "Fixed in every architect's brief before a single line is drawn — and proven at handover with one page of numbers per house. <i>Design choices, not promises.</i>", "coast.h": "Pines, dunes, the Atlantic.<br><em>Forty minutes from Lisbon, still quiet.</em>", "coast.p": "South of the Tagus the coast turns to umbrella pines, a lagoon that meets the ocean, and a beach village that still closes for lunch. Leveza begins here, where this landscape runs closest to the capital: the same light, the same trees, a fraction of the distance.", "meco.soon": "Coming soon", "shot.side": "The quiet side · master patio", "shot.pool": "Loggia, boardwalk, pool", "shot.evening": "19:30 · the kitchen opens onto the evening", "buy.li1": "Dentro: the house room by room, and its materials", "buy.li3": "The four standards, written as numbers", "buy.li4": "First notice when houses are released", "buy.note": "Open as soon as you confirm your e-mail address.", "form.kicker": "Join the waiting list", "form.kicker.inv": "Investors · on request", "form.p": "We send one e-mail with a link. Click it and the door opens — no password to remember.", "f.name": "Name", "f.email": "E-mail", "f.msg": "Anything you'd like us to know (optional)", "f.consent": "I agree that Leveza keeps these details to contact me about its projects. <a href=\"#privacy\">Privacy note</a>.", "f.sending": "Sending…", "f.have": "Already registered? <a href=\"#acesso\">Sign in</a>", "f.err.required": "Please fill in your name and a valid e-mail address, and tick the box.", "f.err.generic": "That didn't go through. Please try again in a minute.", "f.err.config": "Registration is not switched on yet.", "sent.h": "Check your inbox.", "sent.buyer": "We sent a link to <b>{email}</b>. Click it to confirm your address — the buyers' side opens straight away.", "sent.investor": "We sent a link to <b>{email}</b>. Click it to confirm your address. We review every investor request personally and write to you when the investor side is open; until then you can already see the buyers' side.", "foot.1": "A development by ZVMS, Lda · Lisbon", "foot.2": "Lagoa Pines · Meco Dunes (coming soon) · Sesimbra, Portugal", "foot.3": "Images are mood images and concept visualisations, not photographs of built houses. All plans are concepts, subject to planning permission.", "foot.privacy": "Privacy", "acc.kicker": "Dentro · for registered guests", "login.h": "Sign in", "login.p": "Enter your e-mail address and we'll send you a link. No password.", "login.submit": "Send me a link", "login.sent": "If this address is registered, a link is on its way.", "login.new": "Not registered yet? <a href=\"#register\">Request access</a>", "acc.hello": "Welcome, {name}.", "acc.hello0": "Welcome.", "acc.logout": "Sign out", "acc.loading": "One moment…", "acc.empty": "This part is being prepared.", "acc.error": "We couldn't load your access. Sign out and use the link in your e-mail again.", "acc.blocked": "This access has been closed. Write to us if you think that is a mistake.", "tab.buyers": "The house", "tab.dentro": "Dentro", "tab.investors": "Investors", "pend.h": "Your investor request is with us.", "pend.p": "We review each request personally and will e-mail you as soon as the investor side is open. The buyers' side is already yours to read.", "decl.p": "We haven't been able to open the investor side for this request. Write to us if you'd like to talk it through.", "reqinv.h": "Would you like to take part as an investor?", "reqinv.p": "The investor side holds the presentation, the project figures and the structure. We review each request personally.", "reqinv.btn": "Request investor access", "priv.h": "Privacy note", "priv.1": "<b>Who.</b> Leveza is a development by ZVMS, Lda (Avenida Arantes e Oliveira 3, R/C, 1900-221 Lisbon, Portugal; company number 519729544). ZVMS is responsible for the personal data collected on this website.", "priv.2": "<b>What and why.</b> When you register we keep your name, e-mail address, language, whether you registered as a buyer or an investor, your message and the time you gave consent. If you ask for a call or a visit we also keep your phone number. We use these details to give you access to the closed part of this site and to contact you about Leveza's projects. The legal basis is your consent.", "priv.5": "<b>Counting visits.</b> We count page views without cookies and without storing your IP address or anything else that identifies you: only the language, the type of device, the time zone and the website you came from.", "priv.3": "<b>Where and how long.</b> The data is stored with our hosting, database and e-mail providers within the European Union and is not passed on to anyone else. We keep it until you withdraw your consent, and no longer than two years after our last contact.", "priv.4": "<b>Your rights.</b> You can ask to see, correct or delete your data, or withdraw your consent, at any time by writing to <a href=\"mailto:info@levezaliving.com\">info@levezaliving.com</a>. You may also lodge a complaint with the Portuguese data protection authority (CNPD) or the authority in your own country.", "nav.house": "The house", "nav.idea": "The idea", "nav.place": "The place", "nav.cta": "See the floor plans", "hero.kicker": "Lagoa Pines · Lagoa de Albufeira, Sesimbra", "hero.h": "Seven houses among the pines,<br><em>forty minutes from Lisbon.</em>", "hero.sub": "White lime, a loggia under reed, a pool built for lengths. In design now; registered buyers are the first to hear when the houses are released.", "fact.1.v": "7", "fact.1.l": "houses", "fact.2.v": "≈ 177 m²", "fact.2.l": "living area", "fact.3.v": "3–4", "fact.3.l": "bedrooms", "fact.4.v": "10 m", "fact.4.l": "private pool", "fact.5.v": "36 km", "fact.5.l": "to Lisbon", "fact.6.v": "≈ €655,000", "fact.6.l": "price indication", "idea.kicker": "The idea", "agua.p": "A 10-metre pool, heated for spring and autumn. Built for lengths, not for the photograph.", "sombra.p": "A loggia 5.5 metres deep under reed. Full shade in August, low sun indoors in December.", "mesa.p": "The kitchen is the largest room: 32 m², opening full-width onto 42 m² of loggia.", "sono.p": "Every bedroom faces east. Lime and cork keep the rooms quiet and cool.", "house.kicker": "The house", "house.h": "One concept,<br><em>seven houses.</em>", "house.p": "A low white house in hand-applied lime plaster. The upper floor steps back, so the garden side stays horizontal among the pines. Below it, a loggia under reed runs the full width and opens the kitchen to the pool. One stone floor runs from inside to outside without a threshold, then becomes a timber boardwalk to the water.", "door.h": "After you register", "buy.li2": "Floor plans, section and plot drawing", "coast.kicker": "The place", "place.cap": "Between two waters", "dist.1.l": "Lagoon and ocean beach", "dist.1.v": "2.7 km", "dist.2.v": "5.6 km · 8 min", "dist.3.v": "11.6 km · 17 min", "dist.4.l": "Central Lisbon", "dist.4.v": "36 km · 42–51 min", "dist.5.l": "Lisbon airport", "dist.5.v": "45 km · about an hour", "place.map": "Show Lagoa de Albufeira on the map", "place.meco": "<b>Meco Dunes</b> · a second neighbourhood near Aldeia do Meco, among the dunes.", "who.kicker": "Who is behind it", "who.p": "Leveza is developed by ZVMS, Lda, a Portuguese company based in Lisbon and founded by four partners from the Netherlands. The architect is <a href=\"https://miguelferreiraarquitectos.pt/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Miguel Ferreira Arquitectos</a>.", "form.h": "See the floor plans.<br><em>Hear first.</em>", "form.h.inv": "The investor file.<br><em>On request.</em>", "f.submit": "Send me the link", "f.submit.inv": "Request the investor file", "inv.line": "Taking part as an investor? <a href=\"#register\" data-role=\"investor\">Request the investor file</a>.", "inv.mode": "You are requesting the investor file. We review every request personally before opening it. Information for investors is provided on request only; nothing on this page is an offer. <a href=\"#register\" data-role=\"buyer\">Register as a buyer instead</a>.", "peek.cap": "A first look · kitchen, loggia and pool", "go.h": "One click<br><em>and the door opens.</em>", "go.p": "You came here from our e-mail. Press the button to confirm it is you.", "go.btn": "Open Leveza", "next.h": "The next step", "next.p": "A conversation with the founders, or a visit to the plot among the pines. Tell us which, and we get in touch.", "next.call": "I'd like a call", "next.visit": "I'd like to visit the plot", "next.phone": "Phone number (optional)", "next.note": "When suits you, or anything else (optional)", "next.send": "Send my request", "next.or": "Or write to us: <a href=\"mailto:info@levezaliving.com\">info@levezaliving.com</a>", "next.done.h": "Thank you. We'll be in touch.", "next.done.p": "Your request is with the founders. You will hear from us by e-mail or by phone."}, "nl": {"nav.login": "Inloggen", "nav.home": "Terug naar Leveza", "motto": "Wij ontwerpen plekken waar goed ontwerp, een lang leven en het gemak van de kust samenkomen — gebouwd rond hoe mensen zich werkelijk willen&nbsp;voelen.", "lux.h": "Luxe,<br><em>anders gewogen.</em>", "lux.p": "Leveza is luxe gemeten aan wat ze wegneemt: gewicht, lawaai, moeite, hitte. Het gevoel van een lichaam na het zwemmen. Van een huis dat niets van je vraagt. Van een dag zonder verkeer. Alles is van de hoogste kwaliteit en niets dringt zich op — de steen, de kalk, het linnen, de stilte.", "std.kicker": "De vier standaarden", "agua.s": "07:04 · water", "sombra.s": "13:00 · schaduw", "mesa.s": "19:30 · de tafel", "sono.s": "23:10 · slaap", "std.note": "Vastgelegd in elke opdracht aan de architect voordat er één lijn is getekend — en bij oplevering aangetoond met één pagina cijfers per huis. <i>Ontwerpkeuzes, geen beloftes.</i>", "coast.h": "Dennen, duinen, de Atlantische Oceaan.<br><em>Veertig minuten van Lissabon, nog altijd stil.</em>", "coast.p": "Ten zuiden van de Taag gaat de kust over in parasoldennen, een lagune die de oceaan raakt en een stranddorp dat nog sluit voor de lunch. Leveza begint hier, waar dit landschap het dichtst bij de hoofdstad komt: hetzelfde licht, dezelfde bomen, een fractie van de afstand.", "meco.soon": "Binnenkort", "shot.side": "De stille kant · masterpatio", "shot.pool": "Loggia, vlonder, bad", "shot.evening": "19:30 · de keuken opent naar de avond", "buy.li1": "Dentro: het huis kamer voor kamer, en de materialen", "buy.li3": "De vier standaarden, uitgeschreven in cijfers", "buy.li4": "Als eerste bericht wanneer huizen vrijkomen", "buy.note": "Open zodra je je e-mailadres hebt bevestigd.", "form.kicker": "Schrijf je in voor de wachtlijst", "form.kicker.inv": "Investeerders · op aanvraag", "form.p": "We sturen één e-mail met een link. Klik erop en de deur gaat open — geen wachtwoord om te onthouden.", "f.name": "Naam", "f.email": "E-mail", "f.msg": "Iets wat we moeten weten (niet verplicht)", "f.consent": "Ik ga ermee akkoord dat Leveza deze gegevens bewaart om contact met mij op te nemen over haar projecten. <a href=\"#privacy\">Privacyverklaring</a>.", "f.sending": "Bezig met versturen…", "f.have": "Al ingeschreven? <a href=\"#acesso\">Inloggen</a>", "f.err.required": "Vul je naam en een geldig e-mailadres in en vink het vakje aan.", "f.err.generic": "Dat is niet gelukt. Probeer het over een minuut opnieuw.", "f.err.config": "Inschrijven staat nog niet aan.", "sent.h": "Kijk in je inbox.", "sent.buyer": "We hebben een link gestuurd naar <b>{email}</b>. Klik erop om je adres te bevestigen — de koperskant gaat dan direct open.", "sent.investor": "We hebben een link gestuurd naar <b>{email}</b>. Klik erop om je adres te bevestigen. Elke aanvraag van een investeerder beoordelen we persoonlijk; je krijgt bericht zodra de investeerderskant open is. Tot die tijd kun je de koperskant al bekijken.", "foot.1": "Een ontwikkeling van ZVMS, Lda · Lissabon", "foot.2": "Lagoa Pines · Meco Dunes (binnenkort) · Sesimbra, Portugal", "foot.3": "Beelden zijn sfeerbeelden en conceptvisualisaties, geen foto's van gebouwde huizen. Alle plannen zijn concepten, onder voorbehoud van vergunning.", "foot.privacy": "Privacy", "acc.kicker": "Dentro · voor ingeschreven gasten", "login.h": "Inloggen", "login.p": "Vul je e-mailadres in en we sturen je een link. Geen wachtwoord.", "login.submit": "Stuur mij een link", "login.sent": "Als dit adres is ingeschreven, is er een link onderweg.", "login.new": "Nog niet ingeschreven? <a href=\"#register\">Toegang aanvragen</a>", "acc.hello": "Welkom, {name}.", "acc.hello0": "Welkom.", "acc.logout": "Uitloggen", "acc.loading": "Een ogenblik…", "acc.empty": "Dit deel wordt nog voorbereid.", "acc.error": "We konden je toegang niet laden. Log uit en gebruik de link in je e-mail opnieuw.", "acc.blocked": "Deze toegang is gesloten. Laat het ons weten als dat volgens jou niet klopt.", "tab.buyers": "Het huis", "tab.dentro": "Dentro", "tab.investors": "Investeerders", "pend.h": "Je aanvraag als investeerder is binnen.", "pend.p": "We beoordelen elke aanvraag persoonlijk en mailen je zodra de investeerderskant open is. De koperskant kun je alvast lezen.", "decl.p": "We hebben de investeerderskant voor deze aanvraag niet kunnen openen. Laat het weten als je erover wilt praten.", "reqinv.h": "Wil je meedoen als investeerder?", "reqinv.p": "Aan de investeerderskant staan de presentatie, de projectcijfers en de structuur. We beoordelen elke aanvraag persoonlijk.", "reqinv.btn": "Investeerderstoegang aanvragen", "priv.h": "Privacyverklaring", "priv.1": "<b>Wie.</b> Leveza is een ontwikkeling van ZVMS, Lda (Avenida Arantes e Oliveira 3, R/C, 1900-221 Lissabon, Portugal; registratienummer 519729544). ZVMS is verantwoordelijk voor de persoonsgegevens die via deze website worden verzameld.", "priv.2": "<b>Wat en waarom.</b> Bij inschrijving bewaren we je naam, e-mailadres, taal, of je je als koper of investeerder hebt ingeschreven, je bericht en het moment waarop je toestemming gaf. Vraag je een gesprek of bezoek aan, dan bewaren we ook je telefoonnummer. We gebruiken deze gegevens om je toegang te geven tot het besloten deel van deze site en om contact met je op te nemen over de projecten van Leveza. De grondslag is je toestemming.", "priv.5": "<b>Bezoek tellen.</b> We tellen paginaweergaven zonder cookies en zonder je IP-adres of iets anders op te slaan waarmee je te herkennen bent: alleen de taal, het soort apparaat, de tijdzone en de website waar je vandaan kwam.", "priv.3": "<b>Waar en hoe lang.</b> De gegevens staan bij onze hosting-, database- en e-mailleveranciers binnen de Europese Unie en worden aan niemand anders doorgegeven. We bewaren ze tot je je toestemming intrekt, en niet langer dan twee jaar na ons laatste contact.", "priv.4": "<b>Je rechten.</b> Je kunt op elk moment vragen je gegevens in te zien, te verbeteren of te verwijderen, of je toestemming intrekken, via <a href=\"mailto:info@levezaliving.com\">info@levezaliving.com</a>. Je kunt ook een klacht indienen bij de Portugese toezichthouder (CNPD) of bij de toezichthouder in je eigen land.", "nav.house": "Het huis", "nav.idea": "Het idee", "nav.place": "De plek", "nav.cta": "Bekijk de plattegronden", "hero.kicker": "Lagoa Pines · Lagoa de Albufeira, Sesimbra", "hero.h": "Zeven huizen tussen de dennen,<br><em>veertig minuten van Lissabon.</em>", "hero.sub": "Witte kalk, een loggia onder riet, een bad om banen in te trekken. Nu in ontwerp; ingeschreven kopers horen als eerste wanneer de huizen vrijkomen.", "fact.1.v": "7", "fact.1.l": "huizen", "fact.2.v": "≈ 177 m²", "fact.2.l": "woonoppervlak", "fact.3.v": "3–4", "fact.3.l": "slaapkamers", "fact.4.v": "10 m", "fact.4.l": "eigen bad", "fact.5.v": "36 km", "fact.5.l": "naar Lissabon", "fact.6.v": "≈ € 655.000", "fact.6.l": "prijsindicatie", "idea.kicker": "Het idee", "agua.p": "Een bad van 10 meter, verwarmd voor voor- en najaar. Gebouwd om te zwemmen, niet voor de foto.", "sombra.p": "Een loggia van 5,5 meter diep onder riet. Volle schaduw in augustus, lage zon naar binnen in december.", "mesa.p": "De keuken is de grootste kamer: 32 m², over de volle breedte open naar 42 m² loggia.", "sono.p": "Elke slaapkamer ligt op het oosten. Kalk en kurk houden de kamers stil en koel.", "house.kicker": "Het huis", "house.h": "Eén concept,<br><em>zeven huizen.</em>", "house.p": "Een laag wit huis in met de hand aangebracht kalkpleister. De verdieping ligt terug, zodat de tuinkant horizontaal blijft tussen de dennen. Daaronder loopt een loggia onder riet over de volle breedte en opent de keuken naar het bad. Eén stenen vloer loopt zonder drempel van binnen naar buiten en gaat dan over in een houten vlonder naar het water.", "door.h": "Na je inschrijving", "buy.li2": "Plattegronden, doorsnede en kaveltekening", "coast.kicker": "De plek", "place.cap": "Tussen twee wateren", "dist.1.l": "Lagune en oceaanstrand", "dist.1.v": "2,7 km", "dist.2.v": "5,6 km · 8 min", "dist.3.v": "11,6 km · 17 min", "dist.4.l": "Centrum van Lissabon", "dist.4.v": "36 km · 42–51 min", "dist.5.l": "Luchthaven Lissabon", "dist.5.v": "45 km · ongeveer een uur", "place.map": "Toon Lagoa de Albufeira op de kaart", "place.meco": "<b>Meco Dunes</b> · een tweede buurt bij Aldeia do Meco, tussen de duinen.", "who.kicker": "Wie erachter zit", "who.p": "Leveza wordt ontwikkeld door ZVMS, Lda, een Portugese vennootschap in Lissabon, opgericht door vier partners uit Nederland. De architect is <a href=\"https://miguelferreiraarquitectos.pt/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Miguel Ferreira Arquitectos</a>.", "form.h": "Bekijk de plattegronden.<br><em>Hoor het als eerste.</em>", "form.h.inv": "Het investeerdersdossier.<br><em>Op aanvraag.</em>", "f.submit": "Stuur mij de link", "f.submit.inv": "Vraag het investeerdersdossier aan", "inv.line": "Meedoen als investeerder? <a href=\"#register\" data-role=\"investor\">Vraag het investeerdersdossier aan</a>.", "inv.mode": "Je vraagt het investeerdersdossier aan. We beoordelen elke aanvraag persoonlijk voordat we het openen. Informatie voor investeerders verstrekken we alleen op verzoek; niets op deze pagina is een aanbod. <a href=\"#register\" data-role=\"buyer\">Toch inschrijven als koper</a>.", "peek.cap": "Een eerste blik · keuken, loggia en zwembad", "go.h": "Eén klik<br><em>en de deur gaat open.</em>", "go.p": "Je komt hier vanuit onze e-mail. Druk op de knop om te bevestigen dat jij het bent.", "go.btn": "Open Leveza", "next.h": "De volgende stap", "next.p": "Een gesprek met de oprichters, of een bezoek aan de kavel tussen de dennen. Laat weten welke, dan nemen we contact op.", "next.call": "Ik wil graag een gesprek", "next.visit": "Ik wil de kavel bezoeken", "next.phone": "Telefoonnummer (niet verplicht)", "next.note": "Wanneer het je schikt, of iets anders (niet verplicht)", "next.send": "Verstuur mijn aanvraag", "next.or": "Of schrijf ons: <a href=\"mailto:info@levezaliving.com\">info@levezaliving.com</a>", "next.done.h": "Dank je. We nemen contact op.", "next.done.p": "Je aanvraag ligt bij de oprichters. Je hoort van ons per mail of telefoon."}, "pt": {"nav.login": "Entrar", "nav.home": "Voltar a Leveza", "motto": "Concebemos lugares onde o bom desenho, a longevidade e a leveza da costa se encontram — construídos à volta de como as pessoas querem, de facto,&nbsp;sentir-se.", "lux.h": "Luxo,<br><em>pesado de outra forma.</em>", "lux.p": "Leveza é o luxo medido pelo que retira: peso, ruído, esforço, calor. A sensação de um corpo depois de nadar. De uma casa que não pede nada. De um dia sem trânsito. Tudo é da mais alta qualidade e nada se anuncia — a pedra, a cal, o linho, o silêncio.", "std.kicker": "Os quatro padrões", "agua.s": "07:04 · água", "sombra.s": "13:00 · sombra", "mesa.s": "19:30 · a mesa", "sono.s": "23:10 · sono", "std.note": "Fixados no programa de cada arquitecto antes do primeiro traço — e comprovados na entrega com uma página de números por casa. <i>Escolhas de projecto, não promessas.</i>", "coast.h": "Pinhal, dunas, o Atlântico.<br><em>A quarenta minutos de Lisboa, ainda em silêncio.</em>", "coast.p": "A sul do Tejo a costa faz-se de pinheiros-mansos, de uma lagoa que encontra o mar e de uma aldeia de praia que ainda fecha ao almoço. Leveza começa aqui, onde esta paisagem chega mais perto da capital: a mesma luz, as mesmas árvores, uma fracção da distância.", "meco.soon": "Em breve", "shot.side": "O lado calmo · pátio da suite", "shot.pool": "Alpendre, passadiço, piscina", "shot.evening": "19:30 · a cozinha abre-se para o fim da tarde", "buy.li1": "Dentro: a casa divisão a divisão, e os seus materiais", "buy.li3": "Os quatro padrões, escritos em números", "buy.li4": "Aviso em primeira mão quando as casas forem lançadas", "buy.note": "Disponível assim que confirmar o seu e-mail.", "form.kicker": "Inscreva-se na lista de espera", "form.kicker.inv": "Investidores · a pedido", "form.p": "Enviamos um e-mail com uma ligação. Clique e a porta abre-se — sem palavra-passe para decorar.", "f.name": "Nome", "f.email": "E-mail", "f.msg": "Algo que queira dizer-nos (opcional)", "f.consent": "Aceito que a Leveza guarde estes dados para me contactar sobre os seus projectos. <a href=\"#privacy\">Nota de privacidade</a>.", "f.sending": "A enviar…", "f.have": "Já está inscrito? <a href=\"#acesso\">Entrar</a>", "f.err.required": "Indique o seu nome e um e-mail válido e assinale a caixa.", "f.err.generic": "Não foi possível enviar. Tente de novo dentro de um minuto.", "f.err.config": "A inscrição ainda não está activa.", "sent.h": "Veja a sua caixa de entrada.", "sent.buyer": "Enviámos uma ligação para <b>{email}</b>. Clique para confirmar o endereço — a área de compradores abre de imediato.", "sent.investor": "Enviámos uma ligação para <b>{email}</b>. Clique para confirmar o endereço. Analisamos pessoalmente cada pedido de investidor e escrevemos-lhe quando a área de investidores estiver aberta; até lá já pode ver a área de compradores.", "foot.1": "Um projecto da ZVMS, Lda · Lisboa", "foot.2": "Lagoa Pines · Meco Dunes (em breve) · Sesimbra, Portugal", "foot.3": "As imagens são de ambiente e visualizações de conceito, não fotografias de casas construídas. Todos os planos são conceitos, sujeitos a licenciamento.", "foot.privacy": "Privacidade", "acc.kicker": "Dentro · para convidados inscritos", "login.h": "Entrar", "login.p": "Indique o seu e-mail e enviamos-lhe uma ligação. Sem palavra-passe.", "login.submit": "Enviar ligação", "login.sent": "Se este endereço estiver inscrito, a ligação vai a caminho.", "login.new": "Ainda não está inscrito? <a href=\"#register\">Pedir acesso</a>", "acc.hello": "Bem-vindo, {name}.", "acc.hello0": "Bem-vindo.", "acc.logout": "Sair", "acc.loading": "Um momento…", "acc.empty": "Esta parte está a ser preparada.", "acc.error": "Não foi possível carregar o seu acesso. Saia e volte a usar a ligação do e-mail.", "acc.blocked": "Este acesso foi encerrado. Escreva-nos se achar que é um engano.", "tab.buyers": "A casa", "tab.dentro": "Dentro", "tab.investors": "Investidores", "pend.h": "Recebemos o seu pedido de investidor.", "pend.p": "Analisamos pessoalmente cada pedido e enviamos-lhe um e-mail assim que a área de investidores estiver aberta. A área de compradores já pode ser consultada.", "decl.p": "Não nos foi possível abrir a área de investidores para este pedido. Escreva-nos se quiser conversar.", "reqinv.h": "Gostaria de participar como investidor?", "reqinv.p": "Na área de investidores estão a apresentação, os números dos projectos e a estrutura. Analisamos cada pedido pessoalmente.", "reqinv.btn": "Pedir acesso de investidor", "priv.h": "Nota de privacidade", "priv.1": "<b>Quem.</b> Leveza é um projecto da ZVMS, Lda (Avenida Arantes e Oliveira, n.º 3, R/C, 1900-221 Lisboa; NIPC 519729544). A ZVMS é responsável pelos dados pessoais recolhidos neste sítio.", "priv.2": "<b>O quê e porquê.</b> Ao inscrever-se guardamos o seu nome, e-mail, língua, se se inscreveu como comprador ou investidor, a sua mensagem e o momento do consentimento. Se pedir uma conversa ou uma visita, guardamos também o seu número de telefone. Usamos estes dados para lhe dar acesso à área reservada deste sítio e para o contactar sobre os projectos da Leveza. O fundamento é o seu consentimento.", "priv.5": "<b>Contagem de visitas.</b> Contamos as visualizações de página sem cookies e sem guardar o seu endereço IP ou qualquer outro dado que o identifique: apenas a língua, o tipo de dispositivo, o fuso horário e o sítio de onde veio.", "priv.3": "<b>Onde e durante quanto tempo.</b> Os dados ficam alojados nos nossos fornecedores de alojamento, base de dados e correio electrónico na União Europeia e não são transmitidos a mais ninguém. Conservamo-los até retirar o consentimento e nunca mais de dois anos após o último contacto.", "priv.4": "<b>Os seus direitos.</b> Pode a qualquer momento pedir para consultar, corrigir ou apagar os seus dados, ou retirar o consentimento, escrevendo para <a href=\"mailto:info@levezaliving.com\">info@levezaliving.com</a>. Pode também apresentar queixa à CNPD ou à autoridade do seu país.", "nav.house": "A casa", "nav.idea": "A ideia", "nav.place": "O lugar", "nav.cta": "Ver as plantas", "hero.kicker": "Lagoa Pines · Lagoa de Albufeira, Sesimbra", "hero.h": "Sete casas entre os pinheiros,<br><em>a quarenta minutos de Lisboa.</em>", "hero.sub": "Cal branca, um alpendre sob caniço, uma piscina feita para nadar. Em fase de projecto; os compradores inscritos são os primeiros a saber quando as casas forem lançadas.", "fact.1.v": "7", "fact.1.l": "casas", "fact.2.v": "≈ 177 m²", "fact.2.l": "de área habitável", "fact.3.v": "3–4", "fact.3.l": "quartos", "fact.4.v": "10 m", "fact.4.l": "piscina privada", "fact.5.v": "36 km", "fact.5.l": "até Lisboa", "fact.6.v": "≈ € 655.000", "fact.6.l": "indicação de preço", "idea.kicker": "A ideia", "agua.p": "Uma piscina de 10 metros, aquecida na meia-estação. Feita para nadar, não para a fotografia.", "sombra.p": "Um alpendre com 5,5 metros de fundo sob caniço. Sombra total em agosto, sol baixo cá dentro em dezembro.", "mesa.p": "A cozinha é a maior divisão: 32 m², aberta em toda a largura para 42 m² de alpendre.", "sono.p": "Todos os quartos estão virados a nascente. Cal e cortiça mantêm-nos silenciosos e frescos.", "house.kicker": "A casa", "house.h": "Um conceito,<br><em>sete casas.</em>", "house.p": "Uma casa branca e baixa, em reboco de cal aplicado à mão. O piso superior recua, para que o lado do jardim se mantenha horizontal entre os pinheiros. Por baixo, um alpendre sob caniço ocupa toda a largura e abre a cozinha para a piscina. Um só pavimento de pedra passa de dentro para fora sem soleira e prolonga-se num passadiço de madeira até à água.", "door.h": "Depois de se inscrever", "buy.li2": "Plantas, corte e desenho do lote", "coast.kicker": "O lugar", "place.cap": "Entre duas águas", "dist.1.l": "Lagoa e praia", "dist.1.v": "2,7 km", "dist.2.v": "5,6 km · 8 min", "dist.3.v": "11,6 km · 17 min", "dist.4.l": "Centro de Lisboa", "dist.4.v": "36 km · 42–51 min", "dist.5.l": "Aeroporto de Lisboa", "dist.5.v": "45 km · cerca de uma hora", "place.map": "Ver a Lagoa de Albufeira no mapa", "place.meco": "<b>Meco Dunes</b> · um segundo bairro junto à Aldeia do Meco, entre as dunas.", "who.kicker": "Quem está por trás", "who.p": "Leveza é desenvolvida pela ZVMS, Lda, sociedade portuguesa com sede em Lisboa, fundada por quatro sócios dos Países Baixos. O arquitecto é <a href=\"https://miguelferreiraarquitectos.pt/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Miguel Ferreira Arquitectos</a>.", "form.h": "Veja as plantas.<br><em>Saiba em primeiro lugar.</em>", "form.h.inv": "O dossier de investidor.<br><em>A pedido.</em>", "f.submit": "Enviar-me a ligação", "f.submit.inv": "Pedir o dossier de investidor", "inv.line": "Participar como investidor? <a href=\"#register\" data-role=\"investor\">Peça o dossier de investidor</a>.", "inv.mode": "Está a pedir o dossier de investidor. Analisamos pessoalmente cada pedido antes de o abrir. A informação para investidores só é prestada a pedido; nada nesta página constitui uma oferta. <a href=\"#register\" data-role=\"buyer\">Inscrever-me antes como comprador</a>.", "peek.cap": "Um primeiro olhar · cozinha, alpendre e piscina", "go.h": "Um clique<br><em>e a porta abre-se.</em>", "go.p": "Chegou aqui a partir do nosso e-mail. Carregue no botão para confirmar que é você.", "go.btn": "Abrir Leveza", "next.h": "O passo seguinte", "next.p": "Uma conversa com os fundadores, ou uma visita ao terreno entre os pinheiros. Diga-nos qual, e entramos em contacto.", "next.call": "Gostaria de uma conversa", "next.visit": "Gostaria de visitar o terreno", "next.phone": "Telefone (opcional)", "next.note": "Quando lhe convém, ou outra nota (opcional)", "next.send": "Enviar o meu pedido", "next.or": "Ou escreva-nos: <a href=\"mailto:info@levezaliving.com\">info@levezaliving.com</a>", "next.done.h": "Obrigado. Entraremos em contacto.", "next.done.p": "O seu pedido está com os fundadores. Terá notícias nossas por e-mail ou telefone."}};
